ion between the PR service and tinfoil2. We're waiting until people are bac=
k from vacation and up to speed before we decide what to do about this.

*        Both Ross and Richard decided to spend time away from computers ov=
er the holidays so things have not really changed much over the past couple=
 of weeks, there is a small backlog of patches pending which will be worked=
 through this week.

*        M2 will be upon us sooner than we realize and there are some key c=
